  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN273.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">piriviṉkaṭ ṭalaimaka ḷaṟivu mayaṅkic colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What SHE said, [her] knowledge in confusion, during the separation.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN273.1">
        <l>vicumpuvicait teḻunta kūtaḷaṅ kōtaiyiṟ</l>
        <l>pacuṅkāl veṇ<supplied>ku</supplied>ruku vāppaṟai vaḷaii</l>
        <l>yārkali vaḷavayiṟ pōtoṭu parappap</l>
        <l>pulampuṉiṟu tīrnta putuvara laṟ<supplied>ci</supplied>ra</l>
        <l>nalaṅkavar pacalai naliyu nantuya</l>
        <l>raṟiyār kollō tāmē yaṟiyi<supplied>ṉu</supplied></l>
        <l><supplied>na</supplied>m<supplied>ma</supplied>ṉat taṉṉa meṉmai yiṉmaiyi</l>
        <l>ṉammuṭai yulaka muḷḷār kollō</l>
        <l>yāṅkeṉa vuṇarkō yāṉē vīṅkupu</l>
        <l>nilaivaram paṟiyāt takaivaral vāṭaiyoṭu</l>
        <l>mulaiyiṭait tōṉṟiya nōyvaḷa riḷamuḷai</l>
        <l>yacai<supplied>vu</supplied>ṭai neñcat tuyavuttira ṇīṭi</l>
        <l>yūrō reṭutta vampa lañciṉai</l>
        <l>yārāk kāta lavirtaḷi<supplied>r</supplied> parappip</l>
        <l>pulavar pukaḻnta <supplied>nā</supplied>ril perumara</l>
        <l>nilavarai yellā niḻaṟṟi</l>
        <l>yalararum pū<supplied>ḻ</supplied>pavum vārā tōrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="6a-c">Does he not know</l>
        <l corresp="5">of our misery that afflicts [us] with pallor, seizing [our] beauty,</l>
        <l corresp="4">in the newly coming cold season when fresh yield ends in the fields,</l>
        <l>while green-legged white ibises that hurriedly rose to the sky</l>
        <l corresp="1f">like morning glory garlands [now] curb [their] flapping wings</l>
        <l corresp="19ab">[and] spread along with the buds in a wealth of loud uproar?</l>
        <l rend="indent4" corresp="6d">And if he knows,</l>
        <l corresp="8">does he not remember our world,</l>
        <l corresp="7">because of the absence of tenderness [in him], as [it is] in our mind?</l>
        <l corresp="9a-c">[And] I, will I learn where [he is]?</l>
        <l corresp="19cd">– the one who does not come even though,</l>
        <l corresp="12">much prolonging the suffering of the weary heart</l>
        <l corresp="11">with growing young sprouts of pain that appear between the breasts</l>
        <l corresp="9d-10">along with the timely arriving north wind that, increasing, knows no limit for staying,</l>
        <l corresp="15">while the barkless big tree that is praised by the poets,</l>
        <l corresp="14">spreads the shining sprouts of insatiable love</l>
        <l corresp="13">on the pretty branches of rumour raised by the villagers</l>
        <l corresp="16">[and] shades all the borders of the earth,</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="19ab">the buds of gossip are maturing.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="alternate" sameAs="9b">
        <l>[And] I, how can I understand?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
